sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Architect
    Client->>Architect: Hello, I need a messaging app.
    Architect-->>Client: What do you have in mind for technology?
    Client-->>Architect: Mobile version would be great.
    Architect-->>Client: Do you have any specific tech in mind or should I suggest something?
    Architect-->>Client: Flutter, React, Kotlin, Swift are good options for a mobile app. Which one do you prefer?
    Client->>Architect: Take your time and get back to me with the decision.
    Architect-->>Client: Will text you when I'm done.